acer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Secrets &amp; Extras:</strong> Rewards for completing certain milestones within the other world. These may range from weapons to clothing. Can you find them all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you help your friends survive the darkness that lies beyond and escape this world? Your quest in <strong>Soultracer</strong> will test your courage, wit, and resilience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155760/extras/c3278e1e886fb59539df963b65d632c1.poster.avif?t=1748718943\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155760/extras/c3278e1e886fb59539df963b65d632c1.webm?t=1748718943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155760/extras/c3278e1e886fb59539df963b65d632c1.mp4?t=1748718943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You're the only one who can.</strong></h2>",
